    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuprofwetu wakutena Damakasa. Tiyenu, Damakasa amufumisha dehi kwikala nawa mukala nehi, wakekala kwamulumba hohu vwi-i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikala yakuArowenai ayileka dehi; yakekala yawayimuna yakawutamaŋamu chakadi niniwu wukuyitiyisha woma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuEfweremi himwakashala nawa cheŋa mukala wachipakaku, nimuDamakasa nikudi aSiriya akashalaku, hikwakashala nawa cheŋi wantaku; akekala neyi kulema kwawanyana kaIsarela. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu kulema kwaYakoba kwakazeya, nikutoha kwamuji mbawindi kwakabalumuka kukosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hichakekala neyi hakuŋula ŋayi mukwaku munatidiku yemana, hakumuna nyitu yatidiku nachikasa chindi; mwalalahi chakekala neyi chanonojola ŋayi muntu nyitu yatidiku muchinekineki chawaRefwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, mwakashala yakunonojola, neyi chanyikumunaŋawu muolive, hikukushala tumawundu tuyedi, indi kwiji tusatu tudikunsa yamutayi wakwiwulu, hela tuwana, inai kwiji tutanu tudi kunyitayiyamumbavu, kwakweni kunsa yamutondu wasoŋa. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu muntu wakatala kudi Nleŋi yindi, mesu indi akatala kudi Wajila waIsarela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatala kutumeŋa twakutuŋa namakasinduku, hakalabila nyiyombu nawakishi etaŋwa aneliyi nanyinu yinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Denaifuku odu nyikala yindi yakola yakekala neyi maluŋa alekelawu dehi mwisaŋani hewulu dampidi, wowu alekeluwu kwayiluwu anyana kaIsarela; hakekalamahembi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa wunavulameni Nzambi lwamwena wamwinuweyi, hiwunaanuki ilola diwamwena Ŋovu jeyuku; dichi chiwukutumbila nyitondu yakukutiyisha kuwaha, hiwukushimikila mukishi wakwacheŋa nyitondu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ifuku diwukutumba hiwukukolekaku niikoli, budidi hiwukukenwisha nyitondu yeyi; ilaŋa yiwukukeŋa kwaŋulamu hiyikutemuka mwifuku dakumona kukala niyihuŋu yasweja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O, ipumba danyuza yawantu yayivulu dikuvuma neyi chavumaŋa atuluŋalwiji. O, kukumpuka kwakumpukaŋa nyuza yakumpukaŋa neyi chakumpukaŋa meji amavulu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yakakumpuka neyi chakumpukaŋa ameji amavulu; ilaŋa yena wakayihoshola, akatemukila kwakulehi, akayihaŋa aneyi chahaŋaŋa awu muziiŋu wakumapidi kudi mpepela, neyi lunkuŋu lwanyepomokaŋa kukwinza nvula yeneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumelela himutentu; nibudidiyi chidi kanda hiyadi kwokuku. Diyi yakatambulawu antu atupupaŋa, diyi yakamonawu antu atwiyaloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
